  "brain_first": "按原文查阅 写作标点和句界",
  "sort_order": 1105,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 不要用逗号直接连接两个完整主句：I was tired, I went home. → I was tired, so I went home.",
      "sourcePage": 123,
      "sourceIndex": 2994
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 直接引语用引号；但不会复杂标点时，少用长对话。",
      "sourcePage": 123,
      "sourceIndex": 2995
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 每段围绕一个任务功能，不要一句一段。",
      "sourcePage": 123,
      "sourceIndex": 2996
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 写完检查首字母和句号，尤其语法填空/应用文中小错误很容易丢分。",
      "sourcePage": 123,
      "sourceIndex": 2997
    }
  ],
